Need help with a product or order?
Email {{support_email}} or use the contact form at {{storefront_url}}/contact. For an existing order, include your order reference and the email address used at checkout so we can find it. Please do not send passwords or payment card details.

If something arrived damaged or incorrect, tell us what happened and email clear photos where possible. Contact us within 30 calendar days of delivery. Our Returns & Refunds policy explains what is covered and how we review claims; approved claims do not require a physical return.

You can also email us with delivery questions, cancellation requests or privacy requests.

