{{business_name}} operates TeeBravo at {{storefront_url}}. This policy explains what information we collect when you shop or contact us, how we use it and how to make a privacy request.

Orders and customer support
When you order, we collect your name, email address, delivery address and the items you buy. We keep delivery details with your order so we can fulfill it and help with any problems. When you email us or use our contact form, we keep your message and contact details to respond and manage your request.

Payments
Stripe collects your payment information through its hosted checkout. We receive payment status and transaction identifiers to match payments to orders. Please do not send payment card details by email or through our contact form.

